{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51257","headline":"竹枝词 二 · 圆观","name":"竹枝词 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"身前身後事茫茫，欲话因缘恐断肠。\n吴越溪山寻已遍，却回烟棹上瞿塘。\n（《岁时广纪》三三《中秋》引《甘泽谣》）（见《太平广记》卷三八七引《甘泽谣》。\n《宋高僧传》卷二十有《唐洛京慧林寺圆观传》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"圆观","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51257.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51257","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}